id: competitor-watch-root
name: Competitor Watch
kind: root
version: 0.1.0
description: Daily competitor watch for your product. A scout agent scans each rival's site, news, and social every morning, writes a dated markdown report, diffs it against the previous snapshot, and feeds a dashboard showing where every competitor stands and exactly what changed. Ships with a worked example — the 2004 MP3-player market, seen from the iPod team's desk.
entry: index.md
